WEBVTT

00:00:28.371 --> 00:00:31.788
Sharon Pressler has flown lots of
different kinds of airplanes since then,

00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:35.787
including fighter jets. She
was the first woman in

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:38.162
the US Air Force to fly the F-16.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.996
It's just always been the coolest
looking airplane,

00:00:40.371 --> 00:00:42.121
that bubble canopy and the big engine.

00:00:42.121 --> 00:00:45.079
And it has the highest tolerance,

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:49.162
which is nine times the force of gravity
on the earth, which is significant.

00:00:49.412 --> 00:00:50.412
It can do anything.

00:00:51.121 --> 00:00:54.371
Sheeran's had an extraordinary career
spanning more than three decades.

00:00:54.871 --> 00:00:58.162
But recently, after 14 years as a
pilot with Southwest Airlines,

00:00:58.412 --> 00:01:02.704
she hit a particularly bad patch of
turbulence. Her whole industry did.